# Dudo-Core code owners
#
# Every path is owned by @sfoulad. The per-path entries below record the
# agent that owns each boundary — the human reviewer is the same either way,
# but the mapping is what keeps agent ownership visible in review.
#
# Layout: docs/decisions/0004-repository-structure.md
# The last matching pattern wins.
#
# Note: CODEOWNERS assigns review requests. It does not by itself require
# approval — see docs/operations/github-foundation.md for why no human
# approval requirement is set while this is a single-owner project.

*                           @sfoulad

# --- platform ------------------------------------------------------------
/platform/core/             @sfoulad   # core-agent
/platform/web/              @sfoulad   # web-agent
/platform/capabilities/     @sfoulad   # plugin-agent

# --- extensions ----------------------------------------------------------
/apps/                      @sfoulad   # per-App owner, assigned per task
/connectors/                @sfoulad   # plugin-agent

# --- shared packages -----------------------------------------------------
/packages/contracts/        @sfoulad   # architecture-agent — sole contract author
/packages/sdk/              @sfoulad   # plugin-agent
/packages/testing/          @sfoulad   # qa-agent

# --- governance ----------------------------------------------------------
/agents/                    @sfoulad   # architecture-agent
/docs/                      @sfoulad   # Team Lead
/.github/                   @sfoulad   # Team Lead
/.coderabbit.yaml           @sfoulad   # Team Lead
